Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

serve/autosave.py: a disk fallback for parked conversations — a conversation that
parking skipped (RAM floor) is saved to slot_save_path/autosave and restored when
the client comes back. serve/server.py: HH:MM:SS on every log line (the engine's
stderr goes through a relay thread), --chat-template-file (llama.cpp's option), and
the autosave hook. setup.py: three more i-quants selectable for Qwen3.6-35B-A3B
(UD-IQ3_XXS, UD-IQ2_M, UD-IQ2_XXS) — the whitelist was a pinned-sha256 list, not a
format limit.
